## Conventions

- `docs/api.md` at the project root is the contract with the frontend. Follow it exactly. If the API has to change, update `docs/api.md` in the same change and log the decision.
- List every new setting in `.env.example` in this folder (create it if it's missing; names and safe example values only, never real secrets) **and** in the settings table of `docs/runbook.md`.
- Tests follow `docs/testing.md`: unit tests in `tests/unit/`, integration tests in `tests/integration/`, contract tests against `docs/api.md` in `tests/contract/`. Run the full suite before calling a task done.
- Never open real env files.
